        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: I.O.I, CJ E&M, Mnet\n- Events: Produce 101\n- Concepts: South Korean girl groups, television production budgets\n\nFacts:\n- In 2016, CJ E&M formed I.O.I, a South Korean girl group also known as IOI and Ideal of Idol, through the Mnet reality show Produce 101.\n- Produce 101 had the second-largest budget among shows produced by Mnet, at about four billion won, approximately $3.4 million.",
